### Contoh request Tahap 2 — Peran, kelola user, nonaktifkan barang, upload foto
### Jalankan dengan VS Code extension "REST Client", atau tiru di Postman.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050/api

### 1. Login sebagai admin pusat (akun dari `npm run seed`)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

###
@tokenPusat = TEMPEL_TOKEN_ADMIN_PUSAT

### ---------- KELOLA USER (admin pusat) ----------
### Buat admin site Gunung Megang (site_id 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPusat}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin.gmg", "name": "Admin Gunung Megang", "password": "rahasia123", "role": "admin", "site_id": 1 }

### Buat crew Gunung Megang
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPusat}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "crew.gmg1", "name": "Budi", "password": "rahasia123", "role": "crew", "site_id": 1 }

### Daftar user (filter: role, site_id, search; tambah include_inactive=true untuk melihat yang nonaktif)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?site_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPusat}}

### Ubah nama / role / site user (ganti :id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPusat}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Admin GMG", "role": "admin", "site_id": 1 }

### Reset password user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/3/password
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPusat}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "new_password": "baru12345" }

### Nonaktifkan user (aktifkan lagi dengan true)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/3/active
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPusat}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "is_active": false }

### ---------- LOGIN SEBAGAI ADMIN SITE & CREW ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin.gmg", "password": "rahasia123" }

###
@tokenAdmin = TEMPEL_TOKEN_ADMIN_SITE

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "crew.gmg1", "password": "rahasia123" }

###
@tokenCrew = TEMPEL_TOKEN_CREW

### ---------- HAK AKSES YANG DIHARAPKAN ----------
### Admin site tambah barang di site sendiri → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kunci Inggris", "unit": "unit", "type": "NON_CONSUMABLE", "category_id": 1, "site_id": 1 }

### Admin site tambah barang di site lain → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kunci Inggris", "unit": "unit", "type": "NON_CONSUMABLE", "category_id": 1, "site_id": 2 }

### Admin site membuat kategori → 403 (khusus admin pusat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kategori Baru" }

### Admin site melihat barang semua site → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### Crew melihat barang → hanya site sendiri & aktif (site_id diabaikan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories?site_id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCrew}}

### Crew menambah barang → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCrew}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "unit": "pcs", "type": "CONSUMABLE", "category_id": 1, "site_id": 1 }

### Crew membuka kelola user → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCrew}}

### ---------- NONAKTIFKAN BARANG ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/inventories/1/active
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "is_active": false }

### Admin melihat barang termasuk yang nonaktif
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories?include_inactive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### ---------- UPLOAD FOTO (disiapkan; dipakai saat foto sudah ada) ----------
### Di Postman: Body → form-data → key "image" (tipe File) → pilih foto.
### Di REST Client: ganti path file di bawah dengan foto di komputermu.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/inventories/1/image
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BATAS

--BATAS
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="foto.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto.jpg
--BATAS--

### Hapus foto
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/inventories/1/image
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
